; Lots booked at the edges of their matching rules, one account each:
; a short opened in the transaction that closes the only lot (Assets:Short),
; a lot at cost after a units-only position went back to zero (Assets:Zeroed),
; a {} reduction beside a position without cost (Assets:Mixed), a {}
; reduction of the one lot a reduction at cost left (Assets:Left), a
; reduction by date (Assets:Dated), lots at one number in two currencies
; (Assets:Currencies), and a {} reduction of a lot written with more
; decimals (Assets:Decimals).
2020-01-01 open Assets:Short
2020-01-01 open Assets:Zeroed
2020-01-01 open Assets:Mixed
2020-01-01 open Assets:Left
2020-01-01 open Assets:Dated
2020-01-01 open Assets:Currencies
2020-01-01 open Assets:Decimals
2020-01-01 open Assets:C

